      "id": "claim_4cc2b68653a54f999c447edc7bfe55a4",
      "statement": "The daily sync scheduler in src/arete/scheduler.py runs an asyncio task that wakes every 5 minutes (TICK_SECONDS=300), checks if the scheduled hour (ARETE_AUTO_SYNC_HOUR or DEFAULT_SYNC_HOUR=7) has passed for each athlete, and executes Garmin activity sync, plan adaptation, Garmin push, gamification settlement, Google Calendar sync, session feedback, and notification in sequence, recording the run date to a JSON marker file (last_daily_sync.json).",
